WEBVTT

00:02.478 --> 00:05.970
<i>It seems today that all you see</i>

00:06.082 --> 00:09.176
<i>Is violence in movies and sex on TV</i>

00:09.285 --> 00:12.777
<i>But where are those
good old-fashioned values</i>

00:12.889 --> 00:15.414
<i>On which we used to rely?</i>

00:16.025 --> 00:18.823
<i>Lucky there's a family guy</i>

00:18.928 --> 00:22.590
<i>Lucky there's a man who
positively can do</i>

00:22.697 --> 00:24.221
<i>All the things that make us</i>

00:24.332 --> 00:25.890
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:26.001 --> 00:30.768
<i>He's a family guy</i>

00:35.277 --> 00:38.212
<i>All right, kids, assembly is starting.
Now, please take your seats</i>

00:38.313 --> 00:41.214
<i>for the following presentation
by the US Army.</i>

00:46.254 --> 00:50.247
- What's up, y'all? I'm Sergeant Extreme!
- And I'm Major Awesome!

00:50.358 --> 00:53.758
We're here to tell you
how much the army kicks ass!

00:53.861 --> 00:54.919
Check this out!

01:22.690 --> 01:26.216
The army sounds awesome!
And the recruiter said, with any luck,

01:26.326 --> 01:29.523
I could get the clap
from a 12-year-old Chinese prostitute.

01:29.629 --> 01:31.893
Wow, that's great. You'll be serving
your country,

01:31.998 --> 01:34.228
just like American film legend
Mickey Rooney.

01:34.334 --> 01:37.360
Hi. I'm former biggest star in the world
Mickey Rooney.

01:37.470 --> 01:40.962
And as you may know,
I am totally and completely insane.

01:41.074 --> 01:43.508
I like to yell at mice with my shirt off.

01:46.279 --> 01:49.043
Sometimes,
I like to steal other people's scabs.

01:52.485 --> 01:55.886
How do I stay so crazy?
Mickey Rooney's Crazy Pills!

01:55.989 --> 01:58.889
Take one with breakfast, one with lunch,
and before you know it,

01:58.991 --> 02:01.516
you'll be up on your roof,
pooping in the chimney.

02:01.626 --> 02:03.821
Hold out your stockings, kids!

02:04.029 --> 02:06.896
Chris, you can't join the army.
You're too young.

02:06.999 --> 02:08.626
Besides, the army is weak.

02:08.734 --> 02:11.760
Now, the marines,
those are the men you want to fuck.

02:11.870 --> 02:15.499
Are you kidding, Lois? The army's great!
You get to save money for college,

02:15.607 --> 02:19.407
there's free food,
and all the brown people you can rape.

02:19.511 --> 02:23.038
I am sorry, but he is not joining the army.
Case closed.

02:23.248 --> 02:25.512
I can't believe
they're brainwashing kids like Chris

02:25.617 --> 02:26.641
to serve in the military.

02:26.752 --> 02:28.344
Ah, yes, the bottom 10%

02:28.453 --> 02:30.921
of our high-school class
is off to fight another battle.

02:31.023 --> 02:32.489
<i>- You stole that from The Onion.
- What?</i>

02:32.590 --> 02:35.081
<i>You stole that. I read that in The Onion.
About the war in Iraq.</i>

02:35.192 --> 02:38.855
Well, if that's true, then I'd say
they've got some sharp cookies over at...

02:38.963 --> 02:39.987
<i>What is it again? The Onion?</i>

02:40.097 --> 02:41.826
So if I go up to your room right now,

02:41.932 --> 02:43.559
