a copy of The Onion, right?</i>

02:43.667 --> 02:44.691
No.

02:46.637 --> 02:48.070
- Damn it!
- That's what I thought.

02:50.875 --> 02:53.867
<i>Coming this fall,
if you loved Everybody Loves Raymond,</i>

02:53.978 --> 02:57.607
<i>then you'll love his brother Robert
even more, in Robert.</i>

02:57.715 --> 03:00.377
<i>I bet you Debra really gave it to Ray today.</i>

03:00.484 --> 03:04.352
