04:49.990 --> 04:52.720
What kind of after-school activity
should I do, Dad?

04:52.826 --> 04:54.953
Well, Chris,
there's a lot of fun activities out there.

04:55.061 --> 04:57.086
For example,
I used to be a horse whisperer.

05:00.901 --> 05:04.268
Maybe if she spent some time
on the treadmill, and I was drunk.

05:05.772 --> 05:06.966
