- Oh, don't worry.

15:44.191 --> 15:46.386
I'm sure he means Fraggle Iraq.

15:53.566 --> 15:54.555
This isn't so bad.

15:54.667 --> 15:55.793
Yes, the people are friendly.

15:55.902 --> 15:59.360
