16:31.069 --> 16:32.798
What the hell was that?

16:34.039 --> 16:37.406
Help, help! I mean Charlie, Tango, Cash,

16:37.509 --> 16:40.307
<i>47 Victor Charlie,
Mary Hartman, Mary Hartman!</i>

16:40.412 --> 16:42.141
<i>Roger that.
We're moving to your position.</i>

16:45.617 --> 16:49.314
Chris, your father and I are very upset
by this new attitude of yours.

16:49.421 --> 16:52.912
- I don't care what you think of me!
- Oh, God. I envy that.

16:53.023 --> 16:55.651
I am so self-conscious
about what people think of me.

16:55.759 --> 16:57.283
I am out of here.

16:57.428 --> 17:01.194
You know, I think I may have an idea
what's causing his behavior, Peter.

17:01.298 --> 17:03.198
Look at all this stuff.

17:03.868 --> 17:09.329
Listen to these lyrics.
"I rip it hardcore like porno-flick bitches.

17:09.440 --> 17:12.773
"I roll with groups of ghetto bastards
with biscuits. "

17:12.910 --> 17:15.174
Oh, look, they got a translation
for white people.

17:15.279 --> 17:19.010
"I give 110%
when it comes to helping my community,

17:19.183 --> 17:21.014
"even though I occasionally associate

17:21.118 --> 17:23.279
