the vision to predict something like this.

19:54.366 --> 19:55.458
Damn!

19:57.136 --> 19:59.764
Laura! Laura! Laura!

20:05.377 --> 20:09.905
<i>And the Grammy
for biggest posse goes to Ja Rule.</i>

20:10.015 --> 20:13.882
<i>- What?
- No, Madonna. Posse. Posse.</i>

20:13.985 --> 20:14.952
Oh.

20:17.855 --> 20:20.415
All right, Marilyn Manson
has to be here somewhere.

20:20.525 --> 20:22.823
Good thing we distracted
that guard with that riddle.

20:22.927 --> 20:25.157
What gets wetter as it dries?

20:25.897 --> 20:28.331
A towel. Hey, I've been had!

20:29.400 --> 20:31.197
Hey, look. Right over there.

20:31.569 --> 20:33.059
Hey, Manson.

20:33.438 --> 20:35.668
- What in the world was that for?
- Oh, it's a guy.

20:35.773 --> 20:37.536
That's for ruining our son.

20:37.708 --> 20:40.677
He used to be a sweet boy
until he heard your music.

20:41.212 --> 20:45.341
This old story. If I had a nickel. All right.
Where's your son?

20:45.682 --> 20:49.584
<i>I'm hiding underneath my sheets
for fear he'll point and show his teeth</i>

20:49.686 --> 20:52.450
Chris, we brought someone
you might like to meet.

20:53.290 --> 20:55.952
Oh, my God! Marilyn Manson.

20:56.059 --> 20:59.085
Hey there, Chris.
You working hard or hardly working?

21:00.697 --> 21:02.756
- So, I see you're in a band.
- Yep!

21:02.866 --> 21:05.300
Listen, your parents tell me
you've been acting out a little bit,

21:05.402 --> 21:08.769
and I just wanted to tell you
rock and roll music is cool,

21:08.939 --> 21:12.033
